{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_052_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4fdb2729868812bd8ad90e7d7aa21c826dfa5dd22d8b1dc3d63a9e897da68691", "ja": "でも亜利沙、そろそろ戻って来ないと……\nみんなで、打ち上げに行くんだろ？", "zh": "不过亚利沙，你也差不多该回来了……\n大家要一起去庆功宴的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
