{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_052_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "f73e5146594931b9f7ff475e648b13cc675d94df03a2a38b9f478efba582b4c9", "ja": "あ、あの！　{$P$}さん、みんなも、\nありがとうございました！　最高の公演でした……！", "zh": "啊、那个！{$P$}先生，还有大家，\n谢谢你们！这是最棒的演出……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
