{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_052_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "b9fb48bd5fea3644c7ff1fb0d2680e6f33156800399abd1e2ccba55ca1b30213", "ja": "これからもありさのこと、よろしくお願いします～！", "zh": "今后也请多多关照亚利沙哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
